
# WEB HEADERS - configurable web headers
# Location: /usr/share/walmart_xyz
# 1: static   - The 5 listed above
# 2: via DB   - store number, read from DB, passed in
# 3: auto gen - like the UUID - something unique - epic time in mm (8b) + ipaddress(4b) +  rando number (2b-4b)
# 4: OS gen   - ipaddress - passed in

